<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka T-bills oversubscribed, yields down.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka T-bills oversubscribed, yields down.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields of benchmark 12-month treasury bills fell by 0.56 percentage points at the latest Wednesday's auction which was heavily oversubscribed, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said yields on three and six-month bills fell by 0.25 and 0.48 percentage points.</p>
<p>		   Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,780	     1,544	  10.42 (10.67)</p>
<p>    6 months     3,152		 610	  10.85 (11.33)</p>
<p>    12 months    4,585	     1,449	  11.12 (11.68)</p>
<p>    Total	 10,517	     3,603</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
